{"id":"f0dfaf71d03e0355","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-cor-ordinal-successor.md","title":"Ordinal Successor Corollary","display":"cor-ordinal-successor — Ordinal Successor Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-ordinal-successor","aliases":["58-cor-ordinal-successor"],"display":"cor-ordinal-successor — Ordinal Successor Corollary","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-successor]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-ordinal-successor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-ordinal-successor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ordinal-successor — Ordinal Successor Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"45f08db7cdccaf0b\" href=\"?note=45f08db7cdccaf0b\" title=\"58-df-successor\">58-df-successor</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Succ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Succ}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S\\)</span> (successor operator and successor relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"45f08db7cdccaf0b\" href=\"?note=45f08db7cdccaf0b\" title=\"58-df-successor\">58-df-successor</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ordinal-successor} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ordinal-successor} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The successor of an ordinal is an ordinal.</li>\n<li>Every ordinal is either 0, a successor, or a limit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-successor","status":"resolved","id":"45f08db7cdccaf0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-successor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$ (ordinal predicate, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-successor","status":"resolved","id":"45f08db7cdccaf0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Succ}$ and $\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S$ (successor operator and successor relation, see [[58-df-successor]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Succ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ordinal-successor} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\bigl(\\mathrm{SuccOrd}_S(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha),\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\mathrm{Succ}(\\alpha))\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":862,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-cor-ordinal-successor.md|58-cor-ordinal-successor]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","45f08db7cdccaf0b"]}